    items {
      text: "Event coordination visualisation \n\nBuilding a website to visualise event area and edit it for building a proper system of retail establishments by the \nHost\342\200\231s intention . \n\n* First host give\342\200\231s the overall area dimension of the land \n* Adds (retail )establishment variables  in the website \n* The establishment variables take up a default space (it can be modified )\n* Then the establishments can be edited in the given land visualisation though the website \n* Add roads and waypoint \n* Event land map visualise can be downloaded.\n This feature should support high-resolution exporting in SVG and PNG formats.\n\n"
    }
  }
}
