  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Envisioning Event Space**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a web application to visualize and manipulate event spaces. My aim is to let Hosts design retail layouts. I\'m prioritizing the user experience for this event coordination visualizer to simplify placement of establishments within the event area, considering the host\'s perspective.\n\n\n**Defining Core Features**\n\nI\'ve been defining the initial set of core features. I envision the host starting by inputting the event area\'s dimensions. Then, they\'ll add various retail establishments with default, modifiable dimensions. The focus is on intuitive placement, rotation, and resizing of these establishments on an interactive canvas, with options to add paths and export the map.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
