  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Server Creation**\n\nI\'m now leaning towards creating `server.ts`. Given `@google/genai` installation and the presence of `GEMINI_API_KEY` in `.env.example`, I\'m evaluating whether an Express server with Vite middleware is required, or if a client-side SPA with Vite is sufficient. Let\'s start by generating that server file.\n\n\n**Analyzing Feature Requirements**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the necessary features. Specifically, I\'m defining user features in detail. The framework guidelines suggest that I can safely proxy Gemini API calls server-side, which is good. I need to address the detailed user features. I\'m starting with dimensions setup and land shapes. This involves specifying land areas and handling obstacles, as well as visual indicators. Next, retail establishment types and management variables need analysis.\n\n\n**Defining Establishment Functionality**\n\nI\'m now outlining key establishment functionality. Specifically, the focus is on defining restrooms, trash/recycling stations, and storage. I also want to include a stage and entertainment options like main stage, DJ booth, VIP lounge, and sponsor canopies. I plan to create a custom establishment creator to allow hosts to define custom variable types with default dimensions, color, icon, and pricing. I\'m also specifying default space management including editable dimensions.\n\n\n**Specifying User Controls**\n\nI am now focusing on refining the user control and editing features. I need to make sure I support precise placement (Center, Right, Top, Bottom, Even Distribute, Snap to nearest road). Multi-selection, grouping, and duplication capabilities are also key. I am also working on zoning and area color overlays for clear area definition (e.g., Food Zone, Retail Alley, Security Zone).\n\n**Adding Roading Functionality**\n\nI am now adding roads, walkways, and waypoint mapping. I will implement a road and path tool to draw straight or multi-segment pathways with customizable widths. I\'m also planning to incorporate waypoints such as main entrances, VIP entrances, emergency exits, and service gates. I\'m also planning directional arrows, and crowd flow connectors.\n\n**Implementing Export Features**\n\nI am now implementing high-resolution exporting capabilities. The features will include SVG and PNG outputs. SVG exports will maintain vector graphics with layered elements. PNG exports will support various DPIs up to 4K resolution, with options for grid, legend, and blueprint modes. I\'m also working on layout JSON import and export for local storage and project file saving.\n\n\n**Integrating Analytics Features**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the analytics and event intelligence aspects. I\'ve broken down essential metrics, including land area allocation, utilization percentages, and foot traffic capacity estimation. I\'m focusing on revenue calculators based on stall count and rental rates, along with a crucial fire safety and emergency pathway checker. I\'m also planning the Gemini-powered AI Layout Assistant, which is intended to suggest optimal layouts. I\'m examining the `package.json` scripts and build configuration to incorporate these features smoothly within an integrated Express and Vite structure.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 778499048
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
