  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have built the **Event Area & Retail Coordinator** web application according to your specifications.\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n- **Host\'s Land & Grounds Configuration**:\n  - **Land Dimensions Setup**: Allows hosts to specify overall land width and length in meters or feet, along with shape profiles (Rectangular, L-Shaped, Oval) and grid snap intervals.\n  - **Scale Rulers & Ticks**: Includes visual scale rulers, meter grid lines, and total land surface area calculations (`m\302\262` / `ft\302\262`).\n\n- **Establishment Variables & Default Space Management**:\n  - **Variable Catalog**: Pre-loaded catalog of retail variables categorized into Food & Beverage, Retail & Shopping, Services & Desks, Stages & Entertainment, Amenities, and Security/Medical.\n  - **Modifiable Default Space**: Each establishment variable has defined default space dimensions (e.g., Food Truck `6m x 3m`, Standard Pop-up `3m x 3m`), which hosts can edit globally or customize per placed stall instance.\n  - **Custom Variable Creator**: Host can define brand-new establishment types with custom colors, default space dimensions, daily revenue estimates, and power/water utility requirements.\n\n- **Interactive Land Map Visualizer & Editor**:\n  - **Canvas Controls**: Interactive SVG visualizer with smooth zooming, panning, reset view, and grid snapping.\n  - **Drag, Scale, Rotate & Lock**: Click to place or drag stalls around the land. Rotate 90\302\260, scale width/depth with handles, assign custom stall numbers (e.g., `F-01`, `R-02`), set rental fees, lock positions, duplicate, or delete.\n  - **Collision Detection**: Real-time bounding-box check highlights overlapping stalls with a flashing red warning outline.\n\n- **Roads, Walkways & Waypoint Mapping**:\n  - **Road Path Tool**: Draw paved promenades, pedestrian walkways, service routes, and emergency corridors with customizable lane widths (`3m`, `4m`, `6m`, `8m`, `10m`).\n  - **Waypoint Tool**: Drop Main Entrance Gates, Emergency Exits, Information Signposts, VIP Gates, and Crowd Flow Direction Nodes onto the map.\n  - **Zone Overlays**: Draw semi-transparent color-coded zone regions (e.g., Food Court, Artisan Alley, VIP Lawn).\n\n- **High-Resolution Exporting (SVG & PNG)**:\n  - **Vector SVG Export**: Export lossless SVG vector maps with XML namespace and customizable styling.\n  - **Ultra HD High-DPI PNG Export**: Export high-resolution PNG images up to **4K resolution (300 DPI)** for print and presentation.\n  - **Themes & Overlays**: Choose between Architectural Light, Dark Blueprint, and Monochromatic themes, with options to include Title Block banners, Scale Bars, and Map Legends.\n  - **JSON Project Save & Load**: Download `.eventjson` files to save and reload event ground layouts anytime.\n\n- **Gemini AI Layout Advisor & Spatial Metrics**:\n  - **Server-Side AI Endpoint**: Powered by Gemini (`@google/genai`) to evaluate spatial efficiency, crowd safety compliance, revenue potential, and actionable recommendations.\n  - **Analytics Panel**: Tracks land utilization breakdown, open assembly space, estimated daily rental income, and category counts."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
