  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-slate-50 font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-between px-6 shrink-0 border-b border-slate-700\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-500 rounded flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-white\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n          <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 20l-5.447-2.724A2 2 0 013 15.488V5.111a2 2 0 011.106-1.789l5.447-2.724a2 2 0 011.894 0l5.447 2.724A2 2 0 0118 5.111v10.377a2 2 0 01-1.106 1.789L11.447 20a2 2 0 01-1.894 0z\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"font-bold text-lg tracking-tight\\\">TerrainMapper <span class=\\\"font-normal text-slate-400\\\">v2.1</span></span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-white\\\">Project: Central Plaza Retail Zone</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"h-4 w-px bg-slate-700\\\"></div>\\n      <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 opacity-60 italic\\\">Dimensions: 250m \303\227 180m</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-sm rounded-md border border-slate-600 flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors\\\">\\n        <span>Export SVG</span>\\n      </button>\\n      <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-sm font-bold rounded-md flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors\\\">\\n        <span>High-Res PNG</span>\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Sidebar: Controls & Library -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-72 bg-white border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-4 border-b border-slate-100\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\\\">Land Configuration</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500\\\">Width (m)</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"250\\\" class=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 rounded text-sm bg-slate-50 font-mono\\\" readonly>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500\\\">Height (m)</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"180\\\" class=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 rounded text-sm bg-slate-50 font-mono\\\" readonly>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-4\\\">\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\\\">Establishment Variables</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg hover:border-indigo-300 cursor-pointer bg-slate-50 group\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\\\">Standard Stall</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\\\">3x3m</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\\\">Default retail booth module</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700\\\">Premium Anchor</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-indigo-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-indigo-800\\\">12x10m</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-indigo-600/70\\\">Modified dimensions active</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg hover:border-indigo-300 cursor-pointer bg-slate-50\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\\\">Food Truck Pad</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\\\">8x4m</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\\\">Reinforced utilities slab</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-8 mb-4\\\">Infrastructure</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-2 mb-6\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"flex-1 py-2 text-xs border border-slate-200 rounded bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\\\">\\n              <svg class=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M5 12h14\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/></svg> Road\\n            </button>\\n            <button class=\\\"flex-1 py-2 text-xs border border-slate-200 rounded bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\\\">\\n              <svg class=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 21a9 9 0 100-18 9 9 0 000 18zM12 8v4l3 3\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/></svg> Waypoint\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Main Editor Canvas -->\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 bg-slate-200 relative p-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-full h-full bg-white shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden border border-slate-300\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#e2e8f0 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;\\\">\\n        \\n        <!-- Placed Establishments -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-20 left-20 w-48 h-40 bg-indigo-100 border-2 border-indigo-500 rounded flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-move\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700\\\">MAIN PLAZA ANCHOR</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-indigo-500\\\">12m x 10m</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-72 left-20 w-16 h-16 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center cursor-move\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-600\\\">STALL 01</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-72 left-40 w-16 h-16 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center cursor-move\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-600\\\">STALL 02</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-72 left-60 w-16 h-16 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center cursor-move\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-600\\\">STALL 03</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Road Visualization -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-60 left-0 w-full h-8 bg-slate-200 border-y border-slate-300 flex items-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-full h-[1px] border-t border-dashed border-slate-400 mx-2\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Waypoints -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-[234px] left-[400px] group\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-rose-500 border-4 border-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute top-full mt-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap bg-slate-800 text-white text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded\\\">Main Entrance A</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Canvas Ruler -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-5 border-b border-slate-200 flex text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">0m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">50m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">100m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">150m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">200m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">250m</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Zoom Controls -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 flex flex-col bg-white shadow-lg rounded border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-600\\\">+</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-600\\\">-</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Sidebar: Inspector -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-64 bg-slate-50 border-l border-slate-200 flex flex-col shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-4 border-b border-slate-200 bg-white\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\\\">Inspector</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 italic\\\">Select an element to view and edit details</p>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"p-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-indigo-600/5 rounded-xl p-4 border border-indigo-100\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-700\\\">Active: MAIN PLAZA ANCHOR</span>\\n          </div>\\n          \\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1\\\">Position X/Y</label>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"20.4m\\\" class=\\\"w-1/2 text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"20.1m\\\" class=\\\"w-1/2 text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1\\\">Scale Width/Height</label>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"12.0m\\\" class=\\\"w-1/2 text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"10.0m\\\" class=\\\"w-1/2 text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1\\\">Anchor Point</label>\\n              <select class=\\\"w-full text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n                <option>Top-Left (Default)</option>\\n                <option>Center</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n            <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 bg-slate-200 hover:bg-rose-100 hover:text-rose-600 text-slate-600 text-[10px] font-bold rounded transition-colors\\\">\\n              DELETE ELEMENT\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-8 p-4 bg-slate-900 rounded-lg\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-white font-mono text-[10px] space-y-1 opacity-80\\\">\\n            <div>LOG: Road added at y=60</div>\\n            <div>LOG: Stall-03 snap to grid</div>\\n            <div>LOG: Map ready for export</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Info Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-8 bg-slate-100 border-t border-slate-200 px-4 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-500 shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <span>Selection: Premium Anchor</span>\\n      <span>Layer: Infrastructure (3 total)</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\\\"></div> Cloud Synced</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase\\\">Coord: 124, 88</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-slate-50 font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-between px-6 shrink-0 border-b border-slate-700\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-500 rounded flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-white\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n          <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 20l-5.447-2.724A2 2 0 013 15.488V5.111a2 2 0 011.106-1.789l5.447-2.724a2 2 0 011.894 0l5.447 2.724A2 2 0 0118 5.111v10.377a2 2 0 01-1.106 1.789L11.447 20a2 2 0 01-1.894 0z\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"font-bold text-lg tracking-tight\\\">TerrainMapper <span class=\\\"font-normal text-slate-400\\\">v2.1</span></span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-white\\\">Project: Central Plaza Retail Zone</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"h-4 w-px bg-slate-700\\\"></div>\\n      <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 opacity-60 italic\\\">Dimensions: 250m \303\227 180m</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-sm rounded-md border border-slate-600 flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors\\\">\\n        <span>Export SVG</span>\\n      </button>\\n      <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-sm font-bold rounded-md flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors\\\">\\n        <span>High-Res PNG</span>\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Sidebar: Controls & Library -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-72 bg-white border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-4 border-b border-slate-100\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\\\">Land Configuration</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500\\\">Width (m)</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"250\\\" class=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 rounded text-sm bg-slate-50 font-mono\\\" readonly>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500\\\">Height (m)</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"180\\\" class=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 rounded text-sm bg-slate-50 font-mono\\\" readonly>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-4\\\">\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\\\">Establishment Variables</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg hover:border-indigo-300 cursor-pointer bg-slate-50 group\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\\\">Standard Stall</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\\\">3x3m</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\\\">Default retail booth module</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700\\\">Premium Anchor</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-indigo-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-indigo-800\\\">12x10m</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-indigo-600/70\\\">Modified dimensions active</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg hover:border-indigo-300 cursor-pointer bg-slate-50\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\\\">Food Truck Pad</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\\\">8x4m</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\\\">Reinforced utilities slab</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-8 mb-4\\\">Infrastructure</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-2 mb-6\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"flex-1 py-2 text-xs border border-slate-200 rounded bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\\\">\\n              <svg class=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M5 12h14\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/></svg> Road\\n            </button>\\n            <button class=\\\"flex-1 py-2 text-xs border border-slate-200 rounded bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\\\">\\n              <svg class=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 21a9 9 0 100-18 9 9 0 000 18zM12 8v4l3 3\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/></svg> Waypoint\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Main Editor Canvas -->\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 bg-slate-200 relative p-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-full h-full bg-white shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden border border-slate-300\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#e2e8f0 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;\\\">\\n        \\n        <!-- Placed Establishments -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-20 left-20 w-48 h-40 bg-indigo-100 border-2 border-indigo-500 rounded flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-move\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700\\\">MAIN PLAZA ANCHOR</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-indigo-500\\\">12m x 10m</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-72 left-20 w-16 h-16 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center cursor-move\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-600\\\">STALL 01</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-72 left-40 w-16 h-16 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center cursor-move\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-600\\\">STALL 02</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-72 left-60 w-16 h-16 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center cursor-move\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-600\\\">STALL 03</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Road Visualization -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-60 left-0 w-full h-8 bg-slate-200 border-y border-slate-300 flex items-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-full h-[1px] border-t border-dashed border-slate-400 mx-2\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Waypoints -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-[234px] left-[400px] group\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-rose-500 border-4 border-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute top-full mt-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap bg-slate-800 text-white text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded\\\">Main Entrance A</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Canvas Ruler -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-5 border-b border-slate-200 flex text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">0m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">50m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">100m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">150m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">200m</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-r border-slate-200 w-20 px-1\\\">250m</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Zoom Controls -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 flex flex-col bg-white shadow-lg rounded border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-600\\\">+</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-600\\\">-</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Sidebar: Inspector -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-64 bg-slate-50 border-l border-slate-200 flex flex-col shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-4 border-b border-slate-200 bg-white\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\\\">Inspector</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 italic\\\">Select an element to view and edit details</p>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"p-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-indigo-600/5 rounded-xl p-4 border border-indigo-100\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-700\\\">Active: MAIN PLAZA ANCHOR</span>\\n          </div>\\n          \\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1\\\">Position X/Y</label>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"20.4m\\\" class=\\\"w-1/2 text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"20.1m\\\" class=\\\"w-1/2 text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1\\\">Scale Width/Height</label>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"12.0m\\\" class=\\\"w-1/2 text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"10.0m\\\" class=\\\"w-1/2 text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label class=\\\"block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1\\\">Anchor Point</label>\\n              <select class=\\\"w-full text-xs p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded\\\">\\n                <option>Top-Left (Default)</option>\\n                <option>Center</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n            <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 bg-slate-200 hover:bg-rose-100 hover:text-rose-600 text-slate-600 text-[10px] font-bold rounded transition-colors\\\">\\n              DELETE ELEMENT\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-8 p-4 bg-slate-900 rounded-lg\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-white font-mono text-[10px] space-y-1 opacity-80\\\">\\n            <div>LOG: Road added at y=60</div>\\n            <div>LOG: Stall-03 snap to grid</div>\\n            <div>LOG: Map ready for export</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Info Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-8 bg-slate-100 border-t border-slate-200 px-4 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-500 shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <span>Selection: Premium Anchor</span>\\n      <span>Layer: Infrastructure (3 total)</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\\\"></div> Cloud Synced</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase\\\">Coord: 124, 88</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
